</a></h4><div class="RecommendedResourcesBlock__Description-sc-1mt71t6-2 eSTDjl Resource__description">Grab your favorite diagramming tool and develop the system-thinking skills to solve complex backend design challenges related to scaling, data storage, reliability, and performance.
